COMPILATION OF: E51J

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E51J

   1 a 0000 E51J:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-51/P1] SIGNED dividend: z = -a / b.  [C079] -x is <HL> /
   4 a 0006      CALL ?IN20N.  H-J-in20 predicts LHLD a / CALL ?IN20N / PUSH H
   5 a 0006      / LHLD b / POP D / CALL ?ID22N / SHLD z.  H-J-fuse: DR could
   6 a 0006      negate after the divide (SAME quotient only if b divides
   7 a 0006      evenly - bytes distinguish).  H-J-refuse. */
   8 c 0006   dcl a fixed, b fixed, c fixed, z fixed;
   9 c 0006   z = -a / b;
  10 a 0017 end E51J;

CODE SIZE = 001A
DATA AREA = 0008
FREE SYMS = 38BC
END  COMPILATION
